{'symbol': 'SBUX', 'date': '2022-05-03 17:27:00', 'title': 'STARBUCKS COMMITS $1 BILLION IN FISCAL YEAR 2022 INVESTMENTS TO UPLIFT STARBUCKS PARTNERS (EMPLOYEES) AND THE STORE EXPERIENCE', 'text': 'SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STARBUCKS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: SBUX) – TODAY, ON STARBUCKS FY2022 Q2 EARNINGS CALL, CEO HOWARD SCHULTZ ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY WILL MAKE ADDITIONAL INVESTMENTS IN PARTNERS AND STORES FOR PRIORITIZED AREAS SUCH AS INCREASED PAY, MODERNIZED TRAINING AND COLLABORATION, STORE INNOVATION, AND THE CELEBRATION OF COFFEE, BRINGING THE TOTAL INVESTMENTS TO NEARLY $1 BILLION IN THIS FISCAL YEAR ALONE. THIS DECISION ENABLES STARBUCKS TO MEET RECORD CUSTOMER DEMAND AND PARTNER NEEDS'}